1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,333
A tall plant could be T T or T t.

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:04,726
They look identical.

3
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:09,361
To find out, cross it with the homozygous recessive, a dwarf.

4
00:00:09,361 --> 00:00:10,950
That is a test cross.

5
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:14,492
If the plant was T T, every offspring is tall.

6
00:00:14,492 --> 00:00:18,203
If it was T t, you get one tall to one dwarf.

7
00:00:18,203 --> 00:00:22,877
The offspring ratio is a direct copy of the unknown parent's gametes.

